(The ledger's buffer leaves, batch C, round four, 2026-08-30 -
 docs/ledger/buffers.md rows BUF-19, BUF-21, BUF-23, BUF-24, BUF-25,
 BUF-26, BUF-31, BUF-32, BUF-36, BUF-38 - kinds 340-345. Same shape as
 300_gen_buffers_a.vox/330_gen_buffers_b.vox/430_gen_buffers_c.vox: each
 leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted source
 printed in full, the golden is the generated Vox itself, at the true
 top level (nested false) and inside a block (nested true) both.)

Print "--- BUF-19, BUF-21: byte 1 is the first byte, and a variable-indexed byte access reads and writes ---".
'rng seed' of 340.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer byte index' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (a different length/position) ---".
'rng seed' of 341.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer byte index' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 340.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer byte index' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-23, BUF-24: a hex literal and a character literal both write the byte they name ---".
'rng seed' of 342.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer byte literals' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 342.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer byte literals' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-25: declare from a string, mutate one byte with a character literal, the printed content reflects it ---".
'rng seed' of 343.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer content mutation' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 343.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer content mutation' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-26: an out-of-bounds read is refused and the captured value is 0 ---".
'rng seed' of 344.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer oob value' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 344.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer oob value' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-31, BUF-32, BUF-38: append/copy between two buffers, source unchanged by either ---".
'rng seed' of 345.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer append copy sources' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 345.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer append copy sources' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-36: a dynamic destination buffer grows past its initial reserve under append or copy ---".
'rng seed' of 346.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer dynamic destination growth' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (the other verb) ---".
'rng seed' of 344.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer dynamic destination growth' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 346.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer dynamic destination growth' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
